```

This code returns a hard 1/0 indicator per candidate: 1 when at least one used colour is still available to that vertex, 0 when every used colour is blocked by a coloured neighbour (so a fresh colour would be forced); at the first decision (c = 0) it returns all zeros, since every vertex would simply open colour 0 and no ordering information distinguishes them.

